##WHAT IS EBOOK SELLING ON THREADS?
Ebook selling on Threads is a method of earning money by creating and selling digital PDF guides through an audience built on Threads.
The idea is simple: identify problems people are willing to pay to solve, create useful ebooks around those problems and promote them through engaging content on Threads.



HOW DOES IT WORK? - 
Identify a profitable niche and a problem people want to solve.
Research audience demand and existing digital products.
Create an ebook using tools like ChatGPT and Canva.
Upload and sell your ebook through platforms like Gumroad.
Build an audience on Threads by sharing useful and engaging posts.
Promote your ebook and direct interested users to your product link.
Earn money from each successful purchase.



PROS OF EBOOK SELLING - 
No physical inventory or shipping required.
Low initial investment.
One ebook can be sold repeatedly.
Can be managed from anywhere using a phone or laptop.
Multiple niches and product opportunities.
Potential to generate income without showing your face.



CONS OF EBOOK SELLING - 
Finding a profitable niche requires research.
Creating a valuable ebook takes time and effort.
Building an audience on Threads can be challenging.
Competition can be high in popular niches.
Sales are not guaranteed.
Platform fees and payment processing charges reduce your earnings.
